106|  // lesson, so they are written down rather than deleted.
107|  //
108|  //   v1  `/LIMIT 100\b/`            matched the COMMENT explaining the fix.
109|  //   v2  added a backtick to "pin it to the query literal" — matched the same comment, because
110|  //       the comment writes the phrase in backticks. Mention-not-use, twice, inside the very
